284
00:11:52,920 --> 00:11:53,800
Will you fill in?

285
00:11:53,900 --> 00:11:54,660
Pretty please.

286
00:11:55,600 --> 00:11:58,660
Last I checked, you weren't signed up for any solo events.

287
00:11:59,100 --> 00:11:59,800
That's true.

288
00:12:00,300 --> 00:12:03,820
But still, are you sure I'm your guy?

289
00:12:05,480 --> 00:12:07,840
I wouldn't have asked if you weren't the one I wanted.

290
00:12:10,220 --> 00:12:11,820
Yeah, of course.

291
00:12:12,220 --> 00:12:13,020
I'll be right there.

292
00:12:13,720 --> 00:12:14,180
