293
00:12:14,660 --> 00:12:15,560
You'll do awesome.

294
00:12:15,560 --> 00:12:22,020
Miyamura came in third.

295
00:12:22,020 --> 00:12:23,100
What a loser.

296
00:12:24,540 --> 00:12:26,800
These events should just be for athletic people.

297
00:12:27,840 --> 00:12:28,440
That's it.

298
00:12:30,520 --> 00:12:31,640
Made me happy.

299
00:12:32,180 --> 00:12:33,040
You'll do awesome.

300
00:12:33,740 --> 00:12:36,000
Dude who doesn't love having people in their corner.

301
00:12:36,000 --> 00:12:44,340
I guess, with the right people, sports day is actually kind of...

302
00:12:44,340 --> 00:12:48,980
Now, the time's come for our scavenger hunt.

303
00:12:49,080 --> 00:12:50,840
The only co-ed event we'll have today.

304
00:12:51,480 --> 00:12:53,520
Find whatever's written inside your envelope and...

305
00:12:53,520 --> 00:12:55,480
